From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kristof Imeri <kristof@lanth.me>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 22:37:17 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] compositor: let the shell show a frosted wallpaper under app
 glass

The shell hands over a blurred copy of each monitor's wallpaper and says
whether background effects use it. While they do, app glass draws the
piece of wallpaper behind it, with the same saturation, grain and
corners as the blur, and needs no redraw clip, copy or blur at all.

Upstream-Status: luft-only API for Kestrel's glass styles
